define phrase trails-wind-around
  You try following one of the game trails, but it just seems to wind
  around without really getting anywhere.
end phrase

define phrase trails-wind-around-grumble, randomly
  You try following one of the game trails, but it just seems to wind
  around without really getting anywhere.

  'It looks like we're back where we started,' says Pieter.
or
  You try following one of the game trails, but it just seems to wind
  around without really getting anywhere.

  'Didn't we pass this tree before?' grumbles Pieter.
or
  You try following one of the game trails, but it just seems to wind
  around without really getting anywhere.

  'These trails all lead in circles,' mutters Pieter.
or
  You try following one of the game trails, but it just seems to wind
  around without really getting anywhere.

  'Are you there yet?' pants Pieter.
or
  You try following one of the game trails, but it just seems to wind
  around without really getting anywhere.

  'These woods seem to go on forever,' says Pieter.
or
  You try following one of the game trails, but it just seems to wind
  around without really getting anywhere.

  'Where did you say this fountain was?' grumbles Pieter.
or
  You try following one of the game trails, but it just seems to wind
